  "term": "functional status",
  "definition": "Functional status is a person’s ability to carry out basic physical and mental activities, such as moving, paying attention, and communicating. It also includes handling everyday self-care tasks and meeting usual life roles, such as school or play for children and work or household responsibilities for adults.",
